# EmailJS credentials — get these from https://www.emailjs.com/
# 1. Create an account and an Email Service (e.g. Gmail).
# 2. Create an Email Template with variables: from_name, from_email, subject, message.
# 3. Copy the IDs below and rename this file to .env
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
